00002339: TEXT 004A 05 00 80 - - 15A5 0062 1614 161A 0062 1621 1625 162D 1634 162D 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x05 flags=0x00,0x80 "WHAT ... SPEAK LOUDER ... I'M GETTING DEAFER AND DEAFER ..."
