00002449: TEXT 004A FF 20 80 - - 0184 129F 0098 089F 08F7 020F 044D 01CC 1278 036B 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Yes sir , Cap'n Bob . If you say so ..."
00002467: TEXT 004A FF 20 80 - - 16EB 0475 16F4 0475 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "KRUIIIIK !!! AAAaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa !!!"
00002477: TEXT 004A 05 00 80 - - 170D 0050 1718 000C 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x05 flags=0x00,0x80 "COMMANDER, YOU ARE ME ..."
00002489: TEXT 004A 06 00 80 - - 1638 1718 13C8 171C 1721 1728 172B 172F 1739 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x06 flags=0x00,0x80 "WE ARE THE SAME PERSON AT TWO DIFFERENT AGES ..."
000024A5: TEXT 004A 04 00 80 - - 0050 1718 173E 1640 1743 1748 174B 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x04 flags=0x00,0x80 "YOU ARE MUCH MORE THAN MY SON ..."
000024BD: TEXT 004A 05 00 80 - - 028F 0211 0129 174F 0ED9 0062 009A 0286 0129 0CD7 1754 00CF 090E 175A 1762 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x05 flags=0x00,0x80 "We are the same person ... I am the first being to have created itself"
000024E3: TEXT 004A 04 00 80 - - 0307 0DD7 0098 1769 00CF 1770 177B 0098 036E 1786 1762 178C 015F 0050 1718 1794 0098 0913 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x04 flags=0x00,0x80 "And who , thanks to space-time distortion , can watch itself re-live : YOU ARE BOB , COMMANDER ..."
00002511: TEXT 004A 02 00 80 - - 009A 0286 089A 01CC 0CD2 1798 179F 01FE 17A8 01FE 0C42 0519 0238 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x02 flags=0x00,0x80 "I am what you will become hundreds of thousands of years from now ..."
00002535: TEXT 004A 06 00 80 - - 17B2 17B5 0098 01CC 036E 10E8 034F 0238 0062 ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0x06 flags=0x00,0x80 "OK Honk , you can switch on now ..."
0000254F: TEXT 004A FF 20 80 - - 17BA 0475 17C5 0475 014D 169D 096F 12B1 009A 090E 02BC 153C 00CF 04B7 17D2 020F 0A2A 089A 1754 17DB 17E3 0584 17EC 00AD 0098 153C 01DF ; TEXT line=0x004A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "KROIIIIkkk !!! -&KRUIIIIkkk !!! You guys should know I have a right to stay informed . That's what being ONBOARD COMPUTER is all about , right ?"
