00006A91: TEXT 028A 01 00 80 - - 2E54 0062 0B0D 0B15 0098 2E59 01FE 0129 2E61 0F3E 2E67 0098 21DD 0292 2E6B 009A 22C1 01CC 00EF 1278 2E71 01CC 2E77 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x01 flags=0x00,0x80 "Ahhh ... Morning Oil , veteran of the Great Croolis War , reporting for duty. I greet you and say thank you also..."
00006AC7: TEXT 028A 02 00 80 - - 014D 0D2D 0447 0514 0A37 0A3A 0062 2E7F 009A 00A2 2E83 2E89 0098 009A 0E96 1278 0082 2E93 108A 2E9D 2EA2 01DF ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x02 flags=0x00,0x80 "You gave me back my life ... Ah! I feel quite lubrified , I must say ! Recharged batteries too, eh ?"
00006AFB: TEXT 028A 03 00 80 - - 0595 2EA5 09F9 007F 2EAF 0098 2EB6 2EBC 020F 0307 009A 0BCE 04D0 0463 2AB1 020F 05D4 02BC 2EC1 0980 2EC7 042B 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x03 flags=0x00,0x80 "My gratitude knows no bounds , noble ones . And I just love your ship . Not a model I'm familiar with ..."
00006B31: TEXT 028A 04 00 80 - - 2ED0 0098 2A61 095C 2ED4 0AAA 0129 2EDA 009A 117E 0062 2EE5 2EEA 2EF7 0062 2EFE 2F09 2F12 2F12 2F12 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x04 flags=0x00,0x80 "Ahh , if only you'd seen the SPIDER4000 I piloted ... Such invigorating combat ... BABOOOM... VRRRRRRR CHAKA CHAKA CHAKA ..."
00006B63: TEXT 028A FF 20 80 - - 24D9 127C 1EED 015F ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "BIOCONSCIOUSNESS HONK REPORTS :"
00006B73: TEXT 028A FF 20 80 - - 05E4 0EF0 0584 0961 2F18 00BE 090B 01C3 1980 020F 009A 2F21 020B 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "Commander, this is one deranged robot we got here . I hate him ..."
00006B97: TEXT 028A 05 00 80 - - 028F 2F26 02C8 2F2C 00B3 1C60 0098 2F37 0062 2F41 0098 090B 2F49 00CF 2F51 0129 1113 1D58 0129 2F56 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x05 flags=0x00,0x80 "We fired at everything that moved , naturally ... Luckily , we managed to hide the treasure before the end ..."
00006BC9: TEXT 028A 03 00 80 - - 0307 0A37 2F5A 2F62 0129 2F6A 0F3E 1155 0CE1 2F73 0D32 2F78 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x03 flags=0x00,0x80 "And my revered master, the splendid Croolis EVISCERATOR was alas made prisoner ..."
00006BEB: TEXT 028A 04 00 80 - - 08BD 09F9 0C68 0129 0F3E 110F 1113 0584 2F81 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0x04 flags=0x00,0x80 "He knows where the Croolis war treasure is hidden ..."
