00006C15: TEXT 028A FF 20 80 - - 009A 011D 05C4 0BCE 07BC 020B 062B 00EF 10F3 00B3 0A31 0062 ; TEXT line=0x028A voice=0xFF flags=0x20,0x80 "I think I'll just open him up and check that story ..."
